WEBVTT

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:32.000
I thought this would happen someday.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:37.875
I knew you were the only one
who could drive me into a corner.

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:39.958
And...

00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:43.958
...I'm the only one who can defeat you.

00:00:47.417 --> 00:00:49.250
Aria Kanzaki!

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.667
I will defeat you!

00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:23.833
If I disperse the vibrations,
I can avoid that attack.

00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:04.333
I have a dream.

00:03:07.542 --> 00:03:10.833
Aria... An upperclassman I admire
so much... I'll become like her!

00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:12.625
Hm?

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:19.042
Nonoka! Why didn't you wake me up?!

00:03:19.042 --> 00:03:21.375
I tried, Sis.

00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:23.667
But then, you kicked me.

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:25.958
Ah... Sorry.

00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:29.958
Oh, yeah. I was having a
dream about fighting Aria earlier,

00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:32.375
so I must've done it then.

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:34.542
Hm? My cell...

00:03:34.542 --> 00:03:37.083
Where's my cell?

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:40.000
Here you go. I had it charged.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.333
Thanks.

00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:43.042
Geez...

00:03:43.042 --> 00:03:45.708
Put on your bulletproof
school uniform properly!

00:03:45.708 --> 00:03:47.625
Also, you got your gun?

00:03:47.625 --> 00:03:49.375
Yep, you don't have to worry about it.

00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:53.500
I never forget it. This is the
same kind of gun that Aria has.

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.375
Well then, Nonoka. I'm heading out now.

00:03:57.375 --> 00:03:59.542
Watch out for cars!

00:03:59.542 --> 00:04:02.042
I know! See you later!

00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:11.375
I'm Akari Mamiya. I'm in Year 1,
Class A at Tokyo Butei High School.

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:12.125
Ah!

00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:16.000
<i>Butei </i>are the handymen who're
given permission to carry arms

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.875
and solve all sorts of incidents.

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:21.417
The word "<i>butei</i>" means armed detectives.

00:04:21.417 --> 00:04:22.208
Ahh! Wait! Wait for me!

00:04:22.208 --> 00:04:25.708
--Butei High is a school that trains
students to become full-fledged <i>butei</i>.

00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:28.167
I'm in Year 1 there.

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:31.833
And this is the mega-float
where Butei High is located.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.958
I made it!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.250
Good morning, Akari.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.750
Ah, Shino, Raika. Morning!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:44.583
You were rushing quite a bit.

00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:47.292
You're taking a promotion
test for your rank today, right?

00:04:47.292 --> 00:04:50.292
You should come early on a day like this.

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:53.500
What happened?

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.875
We'll stop for a while to
let emergency vehicles through.

00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:10.417
They're chasing someone.

00:05:10.417 --> 00:05:12.458
What?! Criminals?! Are they arresting someone?

00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:14.083
I'm gonna take pictures!

00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:15.625
"Emergency"

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:19.750
Looks like some bank robbers are on the run.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.208
Hm?

00:05:23.417 --> 00:05:26.708
Whoa! So many patrol ships!

00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:29.042
Ah!

00:05:29.042 --> 00:05:30.708
Aria!

00:05:39.125 --> 00:05:40.500
Dodge!

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:52.333
You bitch!

00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:29.542
I'm a <i>butei</i>. Surrender now.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.042
That was incredible, wasn't it, Riko?

00:06:37.042 --> 00:06:39.875
That's Aria Kanzaki from Year 2.

00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:42.250
Kirin, are you interested in her by any chance?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:46.042
Well... she isn't quite my type.

00:06:46.042 --> 00:06:49.792
I've already got someone in mind.

00:06:55.958 --> 00:06:59.000
Boy, we saw some cool stuff
early in the morning, didn't we?!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:04.458
Aria is amazing. Just as expected
from an S-rank <i>butei </i>in Assault.

00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:06.208
Of course she is!

00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:08.833
She's an expert in both
armed and hand-to-hand combat!

00:07:08.833 --> 00:07:10.000
She's from a British noble family

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.750
and worked as a <i>butei </i>throughout
Europe from the age of 14.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.917
She's currently studying in Japan.

00:07:14.917 --> 00:07:20.875
She has an arrest rate of 99%
and people call her "Aria the Quadra."

00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:23.500
You've told us so many times
that it's burned into my brain.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.542
I'll do my best in today's
promotion test for my rank!

00:07:26.542 --> 00:07:31.500
Watching Aria work made me
feel like I might be able to do it!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.125
"Ahhhhhhhhh!"

00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:39.750
You're so pathetic. You call yourself a <i>butei</i>?

00:07:50.667 --> 00:07:52.792
--Ugh!
--That's it!

00:07:56.292 --> 00:07:59.833
Akari Mamiya... was it?

00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:04.208
Maybe you're unfit for
this school. Don't you think?

00:08:07.958 --> 00:08:09.208
Good work!

00:08:09.208 --> 00:08:11.375
I'll wipe off the sweat.

00:08:14.583 --> 00:08:19.333
I'm sorry for failing when
both of you gave me support.

00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:22.958
I heard that that chick's
name is Urara Takachiho.

00:08:22.958 --> 00:08:25.500
They said she's the
daughter of some rich family.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:31.208
She didn't have to shoot
since she had already cornered you.

00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:32.875
It was a bit excessive.

00:08:32.875 --> 00:08:37.083
It was unavoidable.
Takachiho was stronger than I was.

00:08:37.083 --> 00:08:40.958
Life isn't that easy.
I shouldn't resent my opponent!

00:08:43.292 --> 00:08:46.125
Huh?

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:48.833
This thing has too much wasabi in it.

00:08:48.833 --> 00:08:51.625
I'm gonna complain to Nonoka when I get home.

00:08:52.833 --> 00:08:55.667
Akari...

00:08:55.667 --> 00:09:00.417
Well, don't be so down. We're still in Year 1.

00:09:00.417 --> 00:09:02.417
We have a long way to go.

00:09:02.417 --> 00:09:06.667
I'll work with you,
so let's try our best together.

00:09:06.667 --> 00:09:10.583
Who knows? You might
eventually become good enough

00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:13.542
to be able to request
an Amica contract with Aria.

00:09:13.542 --> 00:09:15.792
Amica contract...

00:09:17.125 --> 00:09:22.583
That's right. If I request
an Amica contract with Aria...

00:09:22.583 --> 00:09:25.292
Huh?! Hold on a sec! You mean now?!

00:09:25.292 --> 00:09:26.333
Yep.

00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:29.042
What's an Amica contract?

00:09:29.042 --> 00:09:33.708
You don't know? It's a two-man cell
special training system at our school.

00:09:33.708 --> 00:09:36.875
When you combine the kanji for war
with the kanji for brothers or sisters,

00:09:36.875 --> 00:09:37.833
it is read Amica.

00:09:37.833 --> 00:09:43.042
You receive special training directly
from an upperclassman for a year!

00:09:43.042 --> 00:09:47.333
You can work with them and
receive practical guidance, too!

00:09:47.333 --> 00:09:50.875
You might even be able to take part in
operations where they use code names!

00:09:50.875 --> 00:09:54.250
Seriously, why didn't I think of that?!

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:58.667
Er... Like I said, currently, there's a huge
disparity in skill between you and Aria.

00:09:58.667 --> 00:10:01.125
But I'm free to request it!

00:10:01.125 --> 00:10:04.917
You're wasting your time. I heard that
twenty students were rejected in a row

00:10:04.917 --> 00:10:08.042
when they requested to be Aria's Amica.

00:10:16.542 --> 00:10:19.042
Are you still hesitating, Sis?

00:10:19.042 --> 00:10:22.125
Ah... Nonoka...

00:10:22.125 --> 00:10:26.875
Yeah... I did go get the request form...

00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:31.750
...but I think Raika and Shino are right.

00:10:34.292 --> 00:10:38.167
I think you should do whatever you want.

00:10:38.167 --> 00:10:40.125
Nonoka...

00:10:40.125 --> 00:10:42.542
You have my support, Sis.

00:10:42.542 --> 00:10:47.917
I know that you've admired Aria all this time.

00:10:47.917 --> 00:10:51.083
Don't stay up late, or you'll oversleep again.

00:10:53.083 --> 00:10:56.500
That's right. If I become like Aria...

00:11:02.083 --> 00:11:05.792
...I won't have to go through
something like that again.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:12.000
You'll probably be called in as
a witness for yesterday's incident,

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.000
so be prepared.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.000
Something was strange with those perps.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.833
Their plan was too sloppy.

00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:20.417
Oh, one more thing.

00:11:20.417 --> 00:11:20.833
Hm?

00:11:20.833 --> 00:11:23.458
You have another Amica request.

00:11:23.458 --> 00:11:26.667
Akari Mamiya, Year 1, Class A...

00:11:26.667 --> 00:11:28.042
E rank?!

00:11:28.042 --> 00:11:29.500
Do you know her?

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.917
No, I've never seen her name.

00:11:31.917 --> 00:11:39.000
By the way, in the shooting training,
she ranked 144th out of 144 students.

00:11:40.875 --> 00:11:45.042
It's up to you whether you test her or not.

00:11:45.042 --> 00:11:47.583
Huh?! You actually submitted the request?!

00:11:47.583 --> 00:11:49.208
Yeah.

00:11:49.208 --> 00:11:53.208
Aria is still in Year 2,
but she's a top-ranked student.

00:11:53.208 --> 00:11:55.583
And you're at the very bottom in E rank!

00:11:55.583 --> 00:11:59.208
You wouldn't even have a chance
to talk to her, let alone be her partner!

00:11:59.208 --> 00:12:05.333
Akari, people need to consider
their aptitude... and their own place.

00:12:07.417 --> 00:12:09.667
I know, but...

00:12:09.667 --> 00:12:14.542
An Amica request from the last-place
student is probably a bother to her.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.792
Don't push yourself too hard. Take your time.

00:12:18.792 --> 00:12:21.000
I'll help you.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.542
Aria...

00:12:23.542 --> 00:12:28.875
I think everyone should
be given a chance equally.

00:12:28.875 --> 00:12:30.042
Aria!

00:12:30.042 --> 00:12:33.833
You should've noticed sooner.
If I had been an enemy...

00:12:36.083 --> 00:12:38.417
...you would've been pumped
full of holes by now.

00:12:38.417 --> 00:12:41.417
Akari Mamiya. Fight me.

00:12:47.833 --> 00:12:51.375
Everyone should be given a chance equally.

00:12:51.375 --> 00:12:53.167
But...

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.250
...the results won't come out equally.
It's a matter of the effort you put in.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.458
Aria...

00:12:59.458 --> 00:13:03.167
I'm a busy person,
so I'll test you right here right now.

00:13:03.167 --> 00:13:04.542
Whaaaat?!

00:13:04.542 --> 00:13:08.250
If you can defeat me, I'll agree to
the Amica contract with you. Okay?

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.792
Th-That's... impossible.

00:13:10.792 --> 00:13:13.042
There's no way that I can defeat yo--

00:13:13.042 --> 00:13:16.625
Opportunities...
won't wait for you to be ready...

00:13:16.625 --> 00:13:20.000
...just like crimes and
incidents don't wait for <i>butei</i>.

00:13:22.083 --> 00:13:23.417
A-Akari!

00:13:23.417 --> 00:13:25.125
Akari!

00:13:32.792 --> 00:13:34.542
--Don't jump the gun.
--Ow, ow, ow...

00:13:34.542 --> 00:13:37.542
--I didn't say we'd fight in hand-to-hand combat.
--Ow, ow, ow...

00:13:37.542 --> 00:13:39.083
Huh?

00:13:39.083 --> 00:13:41.417
This... is the same kind of gun I have, huh?

00:13:41.417 --> 00:13:43.458
Y-Yes.

00:13:43.458 --> 00:13:46.833
I have great respect for you, so...

00:13:46.833 --> 00:13:49.167
I see...

00:13:49.167 --> 00:13:52.125
I'll use this gun in the test.

00:13:52.125 --> 00:13:56.833
If you want to be my Amica,
get it back within half an hour.

00:13:56.833 --> 00:13:58.458
What?!

00:14:01.667 --> 00:14:05.333
Akari! I can't help you because
it's against the rules, but do your best!

00:14:05.333 --> 00:14:07.708
Akari!

00:14:07.708 --> 00:14:11.125
I may not be able to do it...
but I'll go do my best!

00:14:14.625 --> 00:14:15.125
"Pedestrians and Bicycles"

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:15.958
"Pedestrians and Bicycles"

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:16.708
"Pedestrians and Bicycles"

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:17.458
"Pedestrians and Bicycles"

00:14:17.833 --> 00:14:18.208
"Pedestrians and Bicycles"

00:15:00.042 --> 00:15:01.917
What the hell is she doing?

00:15:03.292 --> 00:15:04.875
We have to help her!

00:15:04.875 --> 00:15:06.542
Grab my hand!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.375
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:11.375 --> 00:15:15.042
I'm taking an Amica test right now
and chasing after an upperclassman, so...

00:15:15.042 --> 00:15:17.000
Thank you very much!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:23.708
Amica test, huh?
I wonder who she's chasing after.

00:15:23.708 --> 00:15:26.333
You've got an Amica, too, don't you, Kin?

00:15:26.333 --> 00:15:28.792
Ah, yeah, she's a Fuma member.

00:15:28.792 --> 00:15:31.417
Did you call me?

00:15:31.417 --> 00:15:33.083
You were here?

00:15:56.792 --> 00:15:58.292
"Cancel" "Pause"

00:16:06.292 --> 00:16:11.292
Opportunities... won't... wait for you.

00:16:11.292 --> 00:16:13.250
Boy, she's persistent.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.792
Many would've quit by now.

00:16:15.792 --> 00:16:19.917
I'll be Aria's... Amica...

00:16:22.542 --> 00:16:25.042
...for sure!

00:16:29.958 --> 00:16:35.000
Looks like we're being interrupted,
but I won't stop the timer since that's the rule.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.625
Interrupted?

00:16:37.833 --> 00:16:39.417
Ahh!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:50.500
Looks like the friends of yesterday's
robbers came to get them back.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.167
We're being attacked by the perp group!

00:16:53.167 --> 00:16:55.333
Send Assault and Snipe in right away!

00:16:55.333 --> 00:16:57.583
I must share some fated connection with them.

00:16:57.583 --> 00:16:59.625
You stay here.

00:16:59.625 --> 00:17:00.958
Huh?

00:17:03.667 --> 00:17:05.625
Would just Assault do?

00:17:12.667 --> 00:17:14.458
That bitch!

00:17:16.042 --> 00:17:17.708
Watch out!

00:17:21.333 --> 00:17:22.917
Akari!

00:17:24.167 --> 00:17:30.000
To think that she came to help me...
How reckless of her, when she's so weak.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.333
Owwwwwww!

00:17:32.333 --> 00:17:35.000
Looks like she isn't injured.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.833
Those bitches...

00:17:36.833 --> 00:17:39.125
We can't stay any longer. We're withdrawing.

00:17:39.125 --> 00:17:42.417
Got it!

00:17:42.417 --> 00:17:44.667
I got your key!

00:17:44.667 --> 00:17:48.958
She got their car key
by chance. How lucky she is.

00:17:52.708 --> 00:17:54.833
Looks like they won't need our help anymore.

00:17:54.833 --> 00:17:56.125
We'll continue with the test.

00:17:56.125 --> 00:17:57.792
What?!

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:02.125
I'm impressed that you've come this far.

00:18:02.125 --> 00:18:05.917
As a reward, I'll give you
one last chance. Now come at me.

00:18:05.917 --> 00:18:08.708
H-Here?! I can't!

00:18:08.708 --> 00:18:12.833
In return, don't say "I can't"
for the rest of your life.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:18.792
That's a bad phrase that
holds back your potential.

00:18:22.875 --> 00:18:26.292
Aria, please attack me.

00:18:28.667 --> 00:18:29.542
Akari!

00:18:29.542 --> 00:18:31.125
Akari...

00:18:31.125 --> 00:18:33.792
You've been running away.

00:18:33.792 --> 00:18:37.917
I don't wanna be your Amica
when you're running away.

00:18:39.833 --> 00:18:44.458
You can't take back what you said!

00:18:44.458 --> 00:18:48.042
I can do this only when I counterattack.

00:19:00.292 --> 00:19:01.625
I did it!

00:19:03.292 --> 00:19:04.750
Akari!

00:19:17.667 --> 00:19:20.125
I'm sorry that it didn't work out, Akari.

00:19:20.125 --> 00:19:24.333
The disparity in ability between
you two was too big after all.

00:19:24.333 --> 00:19:27.042
Yeah, I know.

00:19:27.042 --> 00:19:28.208
Aria!

00:19:28.208 --> 00:19:29.042
Hm?

00:19:29.042 --> 00:19:32.167
Thank you very much for giving me the test.

00:19:32.167 --> 00:19:34.417
I couldn't become your Amica,

00:19:34.417 --> 00:19:39.583
but I'll continue to work
hard having you as my goal.

00:19:39.583 --> 00:19:42.250
Well then... goodbye.

00:19:47.125 --> 00:19:49.750
You passed the test.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.667
What?

00:19:51.667 --> 00:19:54.500
You did get the gun back once.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:57.333
I'll call it a tie.

00:20:01.375 --> 00:20:05.417
If I hadn't been on guard...

00:20:05.417 --> 00:20:08.500
I passed...? Really?

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:12.333
But you're not my official Amica yet.
You'll be in training.

00:20:12.333 --> 00:20:18.042
You'll have to wait to make the
official contract until you get this gun back.

00:20:18.042 --> 00:20:21.083
Until then, you'll be
my assistant and do chores.

00:20:21.083 --> 00:20:22.500
Would that still be okay?

00:20:24.208 --> 00:20:27.208
Yes! Yes! Yes! Of course!

00:20:27.208 --> 00:20:30.042
As long as I can be with you, Aria!

00:20:30.042 --> 00:20:31.167
Since you're in training,

00:20:31.167 --> 00:20:35.125
you can't investigate crimes or
go after criminals with me, okay?

00:20:35.125 --> 00:20:38.708
You won't be doing those things until
you become my official Amica. Got that?

00:20:38.708 --> 00:20:41.250
Yes, ma'am! I look forward to the training!

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.917
I'm happy for you, Akari!

00:20:42.917 --> 00:20:45.250
Yes, thanks, Raika!

00:20:47.625 --> 00:20:50.083
Shino?

00:20:50.083 --> 00:20:51.542
Oh, nothing.

00:20:51.542 --> 00:20:53.833
Congratulations, Akari!

00:20:53.833 --> 00:20:55.500
Yep, thanks!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.250
Do you wanna go somewhere to celebrate?

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.875
--So that's my first Amica, huh?
--That's a good idea!

00:20:58.875 --> 00:21:00.792
--So that's my first Amica, huh?
--I wanna eat something sweet.

00:21:00.792 --> 00:21:03.125
Not bad.

00:21:03.125 --> 00:21:04.500
But...

00:21:07.625 --> 00:21:09.708
Akari Mamiya, huh?

00:21:09.708 --> 00:21:12.583
That's right. She's an E-ranked Year 1 student,

00:21:12.583 --> 00:21:14.417
but I'm concerned for some reason.

00:21:14.417 --> 00:21:16.958
Concerned? How?

00:21:16.958 --> 00:21:20.125
I don't know. That's why
I want you to check her out.

00:21:20.125 --> 00:21:24.083
I'm pretty sure she's a nice girl, but...

00:21:24.083 --> 00:21:27.708
I feel there's something dangerous about her.

00:21:30.125 --> 00:21:34.458
Understood. I'll report back at a later date.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:44.250
That took a while. You were
supposed to disembark yesterday.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:49.583
Well, I tried to stir up some small fries
to attract the police's attention.

00:21:49.583 --> 00:21:53.958
It did work up to the point of instigating
them to rob a bank using fake information,

00:21:53.958 --> 00:21:56.333
but I got interrupted.

00:21:56.333 --> 00:21:57.208
Interrupted?

00:21:57.208 --> 00:22:02.792
Yep. An interesting person showed up,
so I started it over today.

00:22:04.417 --> 00:22:06.083
Oh well...

00:22:07.458 --> 00:22:08.125
"Episode 1: Another A"

00:22:08.125 --> 00:22:10.167
We still have some time.

00:23:41.583 --> 00:23:45.583
Akari, do you know about
the three-day cancelation rule?

00:23:45.583 --> 00:23:46.375
Shino...?

00:23:46.375 --> 00:23:48.083
I'll be at your side all
the time to care for you.

00:23:48.083 --> 00:23:49.625
You should be able to take care
of things like this yourself.

00:23:49.625 --> 00:23:51.625
Now that you've seen this, you're next.

00:23:51.625 --> 00:23:55.208
I'm gonna become Aria's Amica for sure!

00:23:55.292 --> 00:23:56.160
"Episode 2: Dangerous Relationship"
